WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.992
The thief flew through the air.

2
00:00:02.993 --> 00:00:05.426
"Uh-oh!" he said.

3
00:00:05.427 --> 00:00:11.049
"I went too fast . . . Hey! What's happening?"

4
00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:16.007
The thief floated back to the track.

5
00:00:16.008 --> 00:00:18.012
Ringo grinned.

6
00:00:18.013 --> 00:00:23.075
"Our magnet beam worked, Bot!"

7
00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:25.602
Ringo looked at the thief.

8
00:00:25.603 --> 00:00:29.203
"I'm from Space Patrol!" he said.

9
00:00:29.204 --> 00:00:33.067
The thief groaned.

10
00:00:33.068 --> 00:00:39.954
"Come with me!" Ringo said.

11
00:00:39.955 --> 00:00:48.554
Soon they were back at Race School.

12
00:00:48.555 --> 00:00:52.155
"We got the Astro bike, Gaston," Ringo said.

13
00:00:52.156 --> 00:00:58.611
"We also caught the thief."

14
00:00:58.612 --> 00:01:05.104
Gaston gasped. "Zax! You stole the bike?"

15
00:01:05.105 --> 00:01:09.739
Zax looked at the floor. "I'm sorry, Gaston.

16
00:01:09.740 --> 00:01:11.527
I really wanted to race.

17
00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:14.261
But you said I wasn't ready."

18
00:01:14.262 --> 00:01:21.757
Gaston sighed. "I'll teach you, Zax.

19
00:01:21.758 --> 00:01:24.224
But no more stealing!"

20
00:01:24.225 --> 00:01:32.158
Zax's eyes lit up. "Thanks!"

21
00:01:32.159 --> 00:01:41.461
Ringo and Bot returned to Robo Mart.

22
00:01:41.462 --> 00:01:59.939
"Here's your booster," the clerk said.

23
00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:10.101
Then they went back to base.

24
00:02:10.102 --> 00:02:13.911
"You found the bike," Captain Nova said.

25
00:02:13.912 --> 00:02:18.834
"Good work."

26
00:02:18.835 --> 00:02:23.694
Ringo and Bot went outside.

27
00:02:23.695 --> 00:02:27.882
"I wish I had an Astro bike," Ringo said.

28
00:02:27.883 --> 00:02:31.060
"You have me," Bot said.

29
00:02:31.061 --> 00:02:40.658
Ringo smiled. "And you have a booster now."

30
00:02:40.659 --> 00:02:43.226
"Hop on!" Bot said.

31
00:02:43.227 --> 00:02:45.704
Ringo jumped onto Bot.

32
00:02:45.705 --> 00:02:49.102
"Hold on tight!" she said.

33
00:02:49.103 --> 00:02:57.842
Zoom!

